-- RFC-0014 — An AI suggestion carries its reasoning
--
-- Amends RFC-0003.
--
-- claim_skills records that the model proposed a skill, and nothing about WHY.
-- ADR-0003 §10 makes a suggestion inert until the contributor accepts it —
-- which is a decision they are asked to make, and a decision needs the argument
-- behind it. Without this column the platform shows "we think you also know
-- Kubernetes" with no evidence, and the only honest answer to "why?" is that we
-- did not keep it.
--
-- Nullable: a user_declared row has no model reasoning to carry, and the
-- contributor's own rationale for claiming a skill is a different field on a
-- different table (skill_requests.rationale).

ALTER TABLE claim_skills ADD COLUMN rationale text;
